#descr "Born in 212 DR, Elminster Aumar was one of the most famous and powerful wizards in all of Faerûn. The 'Sage of Shadowdale' was known from the Sword Coast to the far-off jungles of Chult to the unapproachable east all the way to Thay. Over the course of his centuries-long life Elminster had saved the people of Faerûn from destruction or subjugation on dozens of occasions and earned himself a well-dserved, legendary reputation.

Before he devoted his life to the Mystran faith or even began his wizardly studies, the young Elminster possessed the innate ability to heal himself and detect magical auras at will. He was also blessed with an eidetic memory, that allowed him to recall information from years past in quite an impressive manner and this exceptional intelligence was additionally bolstered over the centuries by multiple castings of the wish spell. 

Elminster had knowledge of every spell that was commonly available to most adventuring spellcasters in the Realms. Though he did not use every spell he knew. Having planewalked far and wide and having seen the price of summoning and binding powerful beings to Faerûn, he generally preferred to avoid magic from the school of conjuration and anything associated with creatures from the lower planes. 

Among his allies were countless heroes of the realms, both alive and dead. Legends like Mordenkainen, Khelben Aruson of Waterdeep, and Mystras own daughters - the Seven Sisters, 3 of whom he raised as children and one of whom, the Simbul, he counts as the love of his long life. Adored by his friends and despised by all those whose dark plans he has thwarted, Elminster humbly accepts his role as the shaper of the realms. 

As one of Mystra's Chosen, Elminster will remain immortal, so long as he is within friendly dominion. 

